Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) These appeals are disposed off;
ii) The judgment and award dated 12.10.2021 passed by the Motor Accident Claims Tribunal, Bengaluru City in MVC.No.6006/2019 is modified;
iii) The claimant is entitled to reduced compensation amount of Rs.4,59,140/- as against Rs.5,15,700/- awarded by the tribunal;
iv) The interest shall be reduced to 6% p.a. instead of 7% p.a. from the date of petition till realisation;
v) The compensation amount shall be paid @ 6% p.a. within a period of four weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
- 12 - NC: 2024:KHC:14950 vi) The amount in deposit before this Court, if any, shall be transmitted to the jurisdictional tribunal;
vii) The amount shall be released in favour of the appellant-claimant upon proper verification;
viii) All other terms and conditions stipulated by the tribunal shall stand intact.
ix) The original records shall be transmitted to the jurisdictional tribunal forthwith;
Sd/-
